            <ArticleTitle>Chronic testicular pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1357-9, 1362, 1365</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The cause of chronic testicular pain is often difficult to define. Careful examination of the inguino-scrotal region is useful. Chronic orchalgia is a diagnosis of exclusion for which a multidisciplinary approach may be rewarding.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
